|---|---|
| 🔴 High | #3 PII exposure on `/users` (auth + field filtering + pagination) |
| 🟡 Medium | #1 Helmet, #2 Rate limiting, #4 CORS, #6 Error handler |
| 🟡 Medium | #5 Validation framework, #7 Logging, #8 Port/proxy config |
| 🟢 Low | #9 Graceful shutdown |

