### 2. ❌ No authentication or authorization layer (A01: Broken Access Control, A07: Identification & Authentication Failures)

There is no concept of a logged-in user, no session middleware, no JWT verification, no API key check. Every endpoint is public.

**Recommendation:** Add an auth middleware and apply it to non-public routes.

```js
function requireAuth(req, res, next) {
  const token = req.headers.authorization?.replace(/^Bearer\s+/i, '');
  if (!token) return res.status(401).json({ error: 'Unauthorized' });
  try {
    req.user = jwt.verify(token, process.env.JWT_SECRET);
    next();
  } catch {
