### 3. ❌ Missing security headers (A05: Security Misconfiguration)

Express does not set security headers by default. Without `helmet`, you're missing `X-Content-Type-Options`, `Strict-Transport-Security`, `Content-Security-Policy`, `X-Frame-Options`, etc.

**Recommendation:**

```js
const helmet = require('helmet');
app.use(helmet());
```

